      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "If $X=\\{105,118,119,123,135\\}$ and $Y=\\{108,119,122,123\\}$, then $X\\cup Y=$",
      "worked_solution": "The set $X\\cup Y$ is the set of all elements belonging to either $X$ or $Y,$ or both. So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}X\\cup Y & =\\{105,118,119,123,135\\}\\cup \\{108,119,122,123\\} \\\\  & =\\{105,108,118,119,122,123,135\\}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
