    "q-36187": {
      "dom_id": "step-q36187",
      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "If $A=\\{3,5,7,19,21,115\\}$ and $B=\\{2,3,4,7,16,19,21,22\\},$ then $A\\cup B=$",
      "worked_solution": "The set $A\\cup B$ is the set of all elements belonging to either $A$ or $B,$ or both. So, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A\\cup B & =\\{3,5,7,19,21,115\\}\\cup \\{2,3,4,7,16,19,21,22\\} \\\\  & =\\{2,3,4,5,7,16,19,21,22,115\\}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
